  <title>Payments received</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Contacts</gui><gui>Payments
  received</gui></guiseq> lists customer payments. Choose the <gui>Fiscal</gui>
  year and the <gui>Customer</gui>, or check <gui>All fiscals</gui> and
  <gui>All customers</gui>. Each payment shows how it was paid and whether it
  has been <gui>Deposited</gui>. The total is below the list.
  <gui>Report hub</gui>, in the window menu, exports it; see <link
  xref="report_hub"/>.</p>

  <section id="edit">
  <title>Correcting a payment</title>
  <p>Check <gui>Edit mode</gui> in the window menu to correct a payment's
  date, amount, type or description in the list. It asks for the
  administrator password. A payment in a closed <link
  xref="fiscal_years">fiscal year</link> cannot be changed, and neither can the
  amount of one already deposited.</p>
  </section>

</page>
